# Student Result Form

A React application that allows users to enter a student's name and marks and displays the student's result as Pass or Fail.

## Features

- Student name input
- Marks input
- Controlled React form
- Pass/Fail result calculation
- Displays submitted student details

## Technologies Used

- React
- JavaScript
- CSS
- Vite

## Result Criteria

Students scoring 40 or above are displayed as **Pass**.

Students scoring below 40 are displayed as **Fail**.

## How to Run

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
